    },
    {
      "displayText": "恭候你多时了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "606D50194F60591A65F64E86300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由紫小姐正在等你，\n所以请前往密阿雷社交对战俱乐部<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n用来对战的场所吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75317D2B5C0F59D06B6357287B494F60FF0C000A62404EE58BF7524D5F805BC6963F96F7793E4EA45BF962184FF14E5090E800100001BE00000A752867655BF962187684573A62405427300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的意思是让你到地下去。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你很清楚让由紫小姐久等\n不会有什么好下场吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684610F601D662F8BA94F60523057304E0B53BB300200100001BE01000A4F605F886E05695A8BA975317D2B5C0F59D04E457B49000A4E0D4F1A67094EC04E48597D4E0B573A5427300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你达到A级后的愿望\n是举办ZA登峰战∞，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n对此我表示由衷的感谢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FBE523000417EA7540E7684613F671B000A662F4E3E529E005A0041767B5CF06218221EFF0C00100001BE00000A5BF96B6462118868793A753188777684611F8C22300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也感到很开心，\n于是决定举办自己的大赛！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n名字就叫做……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F611F52305F885F005FC3FF0C000A4E8E662F51B35B9A4E3E529E81EA5DF1768459278D5BFF0100100001BE00000A540D5B575C3153EB505A2026202600100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超级由紫锦标赛D！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857EA775317D2B952668078D5B0044FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n你知道<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>D<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>是什么意思吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A4F6077E5905300100002FF000006004400100002FF000000662F4EC04E48610F601D5417FF1F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "顶级？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98767EA7FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第一？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C4E00FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "单挑？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53556311FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都无所谓",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD65E062408C130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很遗憾！有我参加本身就是\n顶级了，没有必要专门加上。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88905761BEFF016709621153C252A0672C8EAB5C31662F000A98767EA74E86FF0C6CA167095FC589814E1395E852A04E0A300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好可惜哦！我对自己的爱的确是第一，\n但这不是正确答案。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D53EF60DC54E6FF0162115BF981EA5DF1768472317684786E662F7B2C4E00FF0C000A4F468FD94E0D662F6B63786E7B546848300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "答得漂亮！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B545F976F024EAEFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都无所谓也太没礼貌了吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD65E062408C134E5F592A6CA1793C8C8C4E865427FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只有你和由紫我单挑的锦标赛，\n这就是超级由紫锦标赛D！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA67094F60548C75317D2B6211535563117684952668078D5BFF0C000A8FD95C31662F8D857EA775317D2B952668078D5B0044FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不论赢多少次也只能和我打！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8BBA8D62591A5C116B214E5F53EA80FD548C62116253FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且不管你是否夺冠，\n想挑战我多少次都可以！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E144E0D7BA14F60662F5426593A51A0FF0C000A60F3631162186211591A5C116B2190FD53EF4EE5FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样你理解了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374F60740689E34E865417FF1F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "懂了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "61C24E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不懂",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D61C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n这么快就用上D来回答了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F001000020100000000100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A8FD94E485FEB5C3175284E0A0044676556DE7B544E86FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不行哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就算你是想多听听我的声音，\n这么回答也不高明哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D884C54E6300200100001BE01000A5C317B974F60662F60F3591A542C542C6211768458F097F3FF0C000A8FD94E4856DE7B544E5F4E0D9AD8660E54E6300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总之我们开始吧，\n亲身体验最重要！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B4E4B62114EEC5F0059CB5427FF0C000A4EB28EAB4F539A8C670091CD8981FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开始比赛",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F0059CB6BD48D5B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
